{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FUVWRdgN1I1795268409.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港公開羽毛球錦標賽，丹麥球手安東臣晉級男單決賽。</p><p></p><p>黑衫、世界第三的安東臣，面對排名11的印度球手勒舒亞辛，首局只有早段落後過1分，中段拉開，先贏21-13。</p><p></p><p>過去八次交手，安東臣贏五次。這位29歲丹麥球手，第二局再次在中段拉開，一度領先過9分，最終安東臣贏多局21-13，以局數2-0打入決賽。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.492672+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T20:41:14.069089+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:21.701200+00:00","content_hash":"a8fd1fbcf3b8f6cb8447bb371bf094eced3e9518b2970f1945bde06a44ad8f05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.492672+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}